  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@pla_is_me\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811663/youtube_icon_bcbanf.png\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fEsvPsnqJpz\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811736/discord_icon_bg_rp4omx.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fpla_is_me\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761815764/kofi_icon_bg_sy3foi.png\" alt=\"Ko‑fi\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/PlaIsMe\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811682/github_icon_bg_wmtjei.png\" alt=\"Github\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"> </a></p><p style=\"color:#fc0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center\">⚠️ 需要 Epicfight 最新版本</p><p><strong>EpicFight : Kick Skills</strong> 是一個從 Annoying Villagers 1.4 模組分離出來的模組。它新增一個被動技能，讓你可以用新的按鍵進行踢擊並造成體力傷害，此外，當你被破防或暈眩時，可以再次按下踢擊鍵來逃脫。</p><p>包含一個設定檔，讓你可以修改踢擊造成的體力傷害數值。</p><p>體力傷害機制僅作用於玩家和 Combat Evolution 的怪物。</p>",
